<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-06T00:28:21.594Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:28:21 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed Naga militants continue clashes with security forces in Manipur's Noney district, seizing weapons while rival Naga groups also fight, leaving three dead. Thousands of Tangkhul Nagas rallied in Ukhrul and Kamjong demanding the withdrawal of Assam Rifles and the abrogation of the SoO pact. In Kashmir, IGP Sujit Kumar warned that drug-trade profits are funding terrorist networks and IGP Kashmir said forces are on high alert for any eventuality, while soldiers celebrated Diwali along the LoC under heightened vigilance. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxOeXc0QXlPNVdJQ21odlJkWG1TZ0h4UEhZdkltYm0xYlNVdE04djdQbXZIaEJrTHlfeGVqekJWR2VRZ3FTRENPT0VRSldqUmVQUTZhM1Rmd2VWSVFlS044MlBHV0laaFBGa2htaWxFOFlyNnZXbXdpVkNLUjRzdWtlQ2padnhYNDdZRk9DRHpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOc2JLN2kwYTZDMVk0NTBTbDhCLWcycnl6LTFSa1R0MXFSY2R0S0FfRWQ4QmRtWVVXWGRvZDIzSXc5RmJoM3ItdmRfbGx5SmxkRy1mdnFaMld4aENGUDIzcWpFendlTVBnUTI5S1pNdG5faVJqLWdCUUN3Wk1rdDhYcTRmU0NTUDdOMFRSTmtVQW9NTjdpY193ZDlEbTRnVm1R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of India&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNUEVCN0tDaGRObGRHM1VQcTB3WURGSEhwYTdHZWNXWVAyeFViX0JiLVZHWmtSV3dEUUVrYWt3Ylp0cmd4MkJLcENfeE80YmVSWGhpaFgyT3dCLXRLd2FWMmd4T19DbG9INXktek80WnpZZUdMWE5rY0dhcHhTOVVPZkMxOS1rVU5TemthSUpVZjFhUkExR2dtX05xdThFbVBmZWxGWmUtVVM5aDJnQVd6NVV1VXgwZlF4LUlpRg?oc=5&quot;&gt;